$x_i$ & $=(q_i,\gamma_{i\cdot})\in\mathbb{R}^d\times\Gamma^{n_k}$, Def.~\ref{def:qlocal} & $\mathcal{R}_i$ & values of $A_{ij}$ as $x_i$ varies, at fixed $j$ (\emph{not} row recall $R_i$) \\
