$\mathcal{C}$ & constraint set on a column & $\kappa_j$ & scope bound asked of key $j$: the requirement $|T_j|\le\kappa_j$ \\
\addlinespace
\multicolumn{4}{@{}l}{\emph{Sorted order and recovery, Sec.~\ref{sec:recovery}}}\\
$z_{(r)}$ & $r$-th largest entry of $z$ & $G(k),\ k^\star$ & prefix statistic; support size, Lem.~\ref{lem:prefix} \\
$\supp(\cdot)$ & the set of nonzero coordinates & $T_j,\ m_j$ & target set of key $j$ and its size \\
$\delta_j$ & \emph{inter-set margin} $\min_{i\in T_j}s_{ij}-\max_{i\notin T_j}s_{ij}$; positive iff every target outscores every non-target & $W_j$ & \emph{within-set spread} $\sum_{i\in T_j}(s_{ij}-\min_{i'\in T_j}s_{i'j})\ge0$; zero iff the targets tie, automatic at $m_j=1$ \\
\addlinespace
\multicolumn{4}{@{}l}{\emph{Fidelity, on both margins, Def.~\ref{def:fidelity}}}\\
$S_j$ & column support $\supp(p_{\cdot j})$ & $K_i$ & true \emph{source} set of query $i$ \\
$P_j,\ R_j$ & column precision, recall & $S_i$ & row support $\supp(A_{i\cdot})$ \\
$\rho_j$ & target mass $\sum_{i\in T_j}p_{ij}$ & $P_i,\ R_i$ & row precision, recall \\
$S^{(1)},S^{(2)}$ & support before, after Stage 2 & & \\
\addlinespace
\multicolumn{4}{@{}l}{\emph{Conditional activation and scaling, Secs.~\ref{sec:method-gate}--\ref{sec:method-scale}}}\\
$e_{ij}$ & relation membership, Sec.~\ref{sec:method-gate}; $\mathcal{E}=\{(i,j):e_{ij}=1\}$ & $B$ & query block size \\
 & & $K$ & scores retained per block; $K\ge k^\star$ suffices \\
\addlinespace
\multicolumn{4}{@{}l}{\emph{Selective exclusivity, App.~\ref{app:selective}; stated, not evaluated}}\\
$\mathcal{E}$ & \emph{exclusive subgraph}: the pairs the two programs range over & $\mathcal{E}_{\cdot j},\ \mathcal{E}_{i\cdot}$ & its column and row slices; $|\mathcal{E}_{\cdot j}|$ is key $j$'s \emph{scope} \\
